  "consegna":"Parti dalla milestone 9. Applica l'overlay di routing: registra Vue Router, trasforma App in layout, crea Login/Feed/About/NotFound views, usa un session composable condiviso, collega `meta.requiresAuth` alla navigation policy e configura il fallback Express per i deep link `/vue/*`. Il backend API/auth/SQLite non cambia.",
  "vincoli":[
    "Vue 3.5.40, Vue Router 5.2.0, Vite 8.2.1, Node >=22.18",
    "createWebHistory(import.meta.env.BASE_URL)",
    "route name univoci: login, feed, about, not-found",
    "feed meta.requiresAuth=true",
    "navigation policy pura riusata dalla guard",
    "authStatus distingue unknown/anonymous/authenticated",
    "redirect verso login preserva to.fullPath",
    "redirect post-login accetta solo path interno sicuro",
    "catch-all client-side presente",
    "Express 5 fallback usa wildcard nominato `/vue/{*splat}`",
    "nessun token auth in document.cookie/localStorage/sessionStorage",
    "route guard non sostituisce requireAuth/ownership backend",
    "nessun Pinia, TypeScript, WebSocket o ORM"
  ],
